###  http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#countryUsingDialCode
ies:countryUsingDialCode rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                         rdfs:subPropertyOf ies:relationship ;
                         rdfs:domain ies:TelephoneCountryCode ;
                         rdfs:range ies:Country ;
                         sparx:guid "{8C3F2C71-C7A2-414a-85C2-DFCD2D91D8E5}" ;
                         rdfs:comment "A relationship between a TelephoneCountryCode and a Country that uses that code.Note:  more than one Country may use the same code, and in rare cases a given Country may have more than one code." .


###  http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#cousinOf
