###  http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#friendOf
ies:friendOf rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
             rdfs:subPropertyOf ies:relationship ;
             rdfs:domain ies:ResponsibleActorState ;
             rdfs:range ies:ResponsibleActor ;
             sparx:guid "{13EB3439-497F-49ad-A7F4-DEF8A600F640}" ;
             rdfs:comment "A Relationship between two ResponsibleActor Entities where one is the friend of the other.Note: this should not be considered a bi-directional relationship. Just because one person considers another person their friend does not necessarily mean the feeling is reciprocated. Not that Im bitter or anything. See also Stalking if you must. " .


###  http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#governedPopulation
