###  http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#governedRegion
ies:governedRegion rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                   rdfs:subPropertyOf ies:relationship ;
                   rdfs:domain ies:Government ;
                   rdfs:range ies:Location ;
                   sparx:guid "{72DC3E90-53CE-434d-A5F3-89BDCE08A201}" ;
                   rdfs:comment "The Location which the respective Government is in charge of.See also goverenedPopulation - sometimes Locations have no people, and sometimes people reside outside the region in which they are legally citizens.Note: A Government instance has a start and end date corresponding to its time in power. " .


###  http://ies.data.gov.uk/ontology/ies4#grantedActivityType
