                    rdfs:comment "A link from an ExchangePayload to an rdfs:Resource that is in that payload.If there is no payloadContents link, then it is assumed that all the contents of the file are in the ExchangePayload. Under this circumstance, more than one ExchangePayload would be an error. The payloadContents link will usually refer to a named graph, but it can also be used to refer to individual rdf:Statements and rdfs:Resources." .


