ies:socialisesAt rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                 rdfs:subPropertyOf ies:visits ;
                 sparx:guid "{1D9F0978-EFD2-4e27-9242-219637C574EF}" ;
                 rdfs:comment "A visits relationship between a ResponsibleActor and a Location they socialise in.Note: more often than not, this will be a statement of occasional socialising, so the instance of the ResponsibleActorState should also be an instance of DiscontinuousState. In rarer occasions, it may be used to highlight a single, continuous visit, but in that case, inLocation would generally be used." .


