             rdfs:comment "An Entity whose extent is all the people (PersonState) who share the same belief.Religions may be part of other religions - e.g. Christianity being made up of Catholic, Protestant, Orthodox, etc. 1. The religion ëpracticedí by the respective Person..2. The religion may be qualified to identity a particular sect.3. The Metropolitan Police standard [F] shall be used as the reference data standard" .


